{"language_code":"swe","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Så här slipar du kniven utan att kunna någonting. Du har säkert provat att slipa kniven på en slipsten. Handen skakar, vinkeln ändras. Resultatet blir aldrig detsamma. Med rullknivslipen i trä slipper du gissa. Blocket håller kniven magnetiskt på plats i exakt tjugo graders vinkel. Sen är det bara att rulla trärullen fram och tillbaka längs eggen. Lätt tryck, jämn rörelse. Ingen skicklighet krävs. På några sekunder har du en kniv som skär som ny och den ser lika bra ut på köksbänken som den fungerar. Rullknivslipen i trä. Vassa knivar varje gång.","words":[{"text":"Så","start":0.1,"end":0.18,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0004337085410952568},{"text":" ","start":0.18,"end":0.22,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.038054611533880234},{"text":"här","start":0.22,"end":0.42,"type":"word","logprob":-0.038054611533880234},{"text":" ","start":0.42,"end":0.5,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.007575474679470062},{"text":"slipar","start":0.5,"end":0.84,"type":"word","logprob":-0.005050356189407523},{"text":" ","start":0.84,"end":0.86,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.576278118089249e-7},{"text":"du","start":0.86,"end":0.94,"type":"word","logprob":-3.576278118089249e-7},{"text":" ","start":0.94,"end":0.98,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.6954811548639555e-6},{"text":"kniven","start":0.98,"end":1.66,"type":"word","logprob":-3.298118220603404e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.66,"end":1.82,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000030874729418428615},{"text":"utan","start":1.82,"end":2.18,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000030874729418428615},{"text":" ","start":2.18,"end":2.24,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"att","start":2.24,"end":2.34,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":2.34,"end":2.4,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00001537788011773955},{"text":"kunna","start":2.4,"end":2.66,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00001537788011773955},{"text":" ","start":2.66,"end":2.72,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.4305104514278355e-6},{"text":"någonting.","start":2.7